1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980
Listen to a conversation.

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:06,680
Lisa, you've been taking guitar lessons, right? How's that going? It's good.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,640
I'm having fun and there are four or five songs I can play pretty well now

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,620
I've been thinking about it myself.

5
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:16,320
I just finished a big work project, so I've got some spare time.

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,460
If you'll wait here a minute, I'll give you my teacher's information

7
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,740
She's great. Do you do it online or in person?

8
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,440
I took a few lessons in person to get started

9
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:28,320
It's helpful to have someone show you some basic things,

10
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,760
but now we do it online and it works well.
